{{Quote|Offers the user an arsenal of smoke attacks, and is useful for grinding as a new player.|Shop}}
'''Smoke''' is a {{Common}} [[Elemental]]-type [[Blox Fruit]] that costs {{Money|100,000}} or {{Robux|250}} from the [[Blox Fruit Dealer]]. 

Smoke allows the user to create, become and manipulate smoke - inflicting cloudy, suffocating attacks to opponents.   

