==Overview==
<tabber>
|-|Pros=
{{Overview|Pros
|'''General'''
* [[Elemental]] Reflex / Immunity.
* Easy to obtain and cheap to buy.
* Very low mastery requirements.
* All moves can [[Instinct/Break|break Instinct]].
* Every move can deal damage to [[Sea Beasts]].

|'''[Z] Smoke Slam'''
* Rarely dodged by [[Instinct]].
* Decently short cooldown.

|'''[X] Smoke Blast'''
* Amazing damage if enemies stay inside the [[Area of Effect|AoE]].
* Decent stun.

|'''[C] Smoke Liberation'''
* Good stun.
* Very quick startup time, making it decent for [[PvP]].
* Good [[AoE]].

|'''[F] Smoke Bomber'''
* Can deal damage infinitely (as long as the user is not hit).
}}

|-|Cons=
{{Overview|Cons
|'''General'''
* Range isn't that good.
* Easy to dodge.

|'''[Z] Smoke Slam'''
* Very low range (though it has decent [[Area of Effect|AoE]]).

|'''[X] Smoke Blast'''
* Some players might use [[Flash Step]] to escape it after getting hit.

|'''[C] Smoke Liberation'''
* Can slightly crowd the user's screen.
* Can be dodged with [[Instinct]].
* Short range.
* Hard to use in a combo.
* Can be punished if missed.

|'''[F] Smoke Bomber'''
* One of the slowest flight speeds in the game.
}}
</tabber>

==Trivia==
* Smoke was one of the first fruits added to the game.
* Smoke is the only {{Common}} [[Elemental]]-type [[Blox Fruit]].
* The sound effect of Smoke's Elemental Reflex activating is the same sound effect used by [[Gas]].
* Smoke is the cheapest [[Elemental]] fruit, thus it becomes recommended for newer players.

